{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_62_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"一、元年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_62_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"繼弒君不言即位，正也。親之非父也，尊之非君也，繼之如君父也者，受國焉爾。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_62_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"二、齊人救邢。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_62_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"善救邢也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_62_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"三、夏，六月，辛酉，葬我君莊公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_62_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"莊公葬而後舉謚，謚所以成德也。於卒事乎加之矣。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_62_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"四、秋，八月，公及齊侯盟於洛姑。季子來歸。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_62_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"盟納季子也。其曰季子，貴之也。其曰來歸，喜之也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_62_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"五、冬，齊仲孫來。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_62_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_62","textTraditional":"其曰齊仲孫，外之也。其不目而曰仲孫，疏之也。其言齊，以累桓也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}